+
+Router model IDs are specific to your account. Models listed by `llm anthropic refresh` (see below) use their Router IDs directly. To use one of this plugin's built-in Claude model entries, map it to a Router model ID with the `RAMP_ROUTER_MODELS` environment variable, a JSON object keyed by the plugin's Claude model ID:
+```bash
+export RAMP_ROUTER_MODELS='{"claude-sonnet-5-5": "<router model ID from llm anthropic models>"}'
+```
+A built-in model with no mapping raises an error instead of sending a provider model name to Router.
 
